<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Promet reports 6-mth net loss.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Promet reports 6-mth net loss.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr    (cents)    loss  0.37  vs  profit  0.35</p>
<p>    Net loss		    1.96  vs  profit  1.85</p>
<p>    Turnover		   69.28  vs	  145.42</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    1.40  vs	    6.43</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   8.03  vs	    nil</p>
<p>Note - Promet Bhd is involved in marine engineering and fabrication, infrastructure construction and property development.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
